WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.833
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:12.103 --> 00:13.203
Is it real...?

3
00:14.846 --> 00:16.370
It’s actually for real...?

4
00:32.873 --> 00:34.542
Why?

5
00:37.420 --> 00:39.286
Why are you doing this to us?

6
00:41.340 --> 00:44.436
I guess this means the kiDnap GAME has begun.

7
01:34.616 --> 01:37.049
KIDNAP GAME

8
01:39.455 --> 01:42.750
6 CONTESTRANTS LEFT. 8 DAYS AND 5 HOURS UNTIL THE GAME ENDS.

9
01:44.183 --> 01:45.101
TOKYO

10
01:45.184 --> 01:49.790
Why did you choose us? What are you trying to achieve?

11
01:51.607 --> 01:54.796
So inquisitive. Insatiable.

12
01:56.779 --> 01:58.406
You're slaves to desire.

13
02:00.605 --> 02:03.733
That's one less rival... lucky you.

14
02:06.789 --> 02:08.416
You don't respect life.

15
02:08.499 --> 02:10.584
I can say the same to you.

16
02:10.835 --> 02:14.964
Are some lives worth more than others?

17
02:22.721 --> 02:25.433
- Police! - Here we go.

18
02:25.558 --> 02:29.139
You're gonna use state power and break the rules?

19
02:29.186 --> 02:33.274
I'm arresting you to rescue the hostages. That's all.

20
02:33.337 --> 02:35.965
Do you understand?

21
02:36.318 --> 02:39.155
If you break the rules, your wife dies.

22
02:42.408 --> 02:43.951
You bastard...

23
02:44.034 --> 02:45.619
Excuse me, sir.

24
02:45.703 --> 02:46.941
- Stay back! - Please stop.

25
02:49.957 --> 02:51.021
Don't move!

26
02:53.461 --> 02:56.584
Is this guy's life worth a lot?

27
02:57.134 --> 02:59.110
Or is it worth a little?

28
02:59.135 --> 03:00.690
Stop... Help me...

29
03:04.680 --> 03:06.348
- Move it! - You okay?

30
03:17.526 --> 03:18.027
SEOUL PM 01:04 KST

31
03:18.068 --> 03:20.613
I told you to cut it out.

32
03:21.197 --> 03:24.617
I said stop contacting me.

33
03:27.661 --> 03:28.746
MISSION

34
03:28.871 --> 03:30.623
COMMIT MURDER.

35
03:34.697 --> 03:38.909
Let go! Do I need to hit you again?

36
03:39.034 --> 03:40.452
COMMIT MURDER.

37
03:46.500 --> 03:47.918
COMMIT MURDER.

38
03:52.923 --> 03:54.466
COMMIT MURDER.

39
04:02.221 --> 04:02.675
SINGAPORE PM 12:04 SGT

40
04:02.700 --> 04:04.869
Handed by responding police officer.

41
04:05.075 --> 04:07.744
Police believe that the would-be bank robbers were motivated...

42
04:07.837 --> 04:10.173
What do you mean? This is not a prank!

43
04:10.315 --> 04:12.443
Tony will die if I don’t complete this mission.

44
04:12.568 --> 04:14.270
Robbers were motivated by...

45
04:16.071 --> 04:20.242
- Asian Civilisations Museum! Hurry, please! - OK.

46
04:20.367 --> 04:23.912
Where they have the treasure-laden ship that sank! Yes!

47
04:29.337 --> 04:29.796
TAIPEI PM 12:07 TST

48
04:29.830 --> 04:33.793
Hey, you haven't told anyone about us, have you?

49
04:34.460 --> 04:37.088
You deleted the video, right?

50
04:39.131 --> 04:42.093
That's okay, then...

51
04:44.178 --> 04:45.178
ATRA FLOWER SHOP

52
04:52.979 --> 04:54.855
NAHA

53
04:54.939 --> 04:56.983
PM 01:07 JST

54
05:01.404 --> 05:04.084
Let go! Put me down!

55
05:06.826 --> 05:09.437
What do I need to beat this psycho?

56
05:09.954 --> 05:12.710
DON'T WORRY. YOU'RE GONNA WIN FOR SURE.

57
05:18.170 --> 05:19.630
Dammit...

58
05:19.922 --> 05:21.250
BANGKOK

59
05:21.275 --> 05:22.776
AM 11:08 ICT

60
05:27.388 --> 05:28.597
MISSION

61
05:28.598 --> 05:32.518
MAKE BENZ WANG ADMIT AND PUBLICLY CONFESS HIS DRUG SYNDICATE TIES.

62
05:35.438 --> 05:37.315
BENZ WANG

63
05:37.398 --> 05:40.735
POLITICIAN BEHIND CANNABIS LEGALIZATION

64
05:41.319 --> 05:43.571
No way he'd admit to that.

65
05:48.743 --> 05:50.077
Dao...

66
06:01.922 --> 06:03.341
Aum...

67
06:07.136 --> 06:08.930
Help me...

68
06:12.184 --> 06:12.810
PM 02:19 JST SHINJUKU CENTRAL POLICE STATION SPECIAL INVESTIGATION HEADQUARTERS

69
06:12.850 --> 06:17.980
We will not conduct a sloppy investigation like the Manila Police.

70
06:18.105 --> 06:23.110
As it is, we've got zero suspects and nothing on the vehicle.

71
06:23.569 --> 06:29.617
On top of that, the hostage's husband, Toshiro Niide, gave us the slip.

72
06:29.700 --> 06:35.283
Chief Inspector Takatsuki, what should we make of that?

73
06:41.003 --> 06:44.507
Niide wants to arrest the kidnappers by him...

74
06:44.590 --> 06:47.134
A lower-level cop can't handle this!

75
06:48.386 --> 06:49.387
Yes.

76
06:51.430 --> 06:53.849
Find Niide immediately!

77
06:54.141 --> 06:55.434
Yes sir!

78
07:00.106 --> 07:04.068
"kiDnap GAME." You really haven't heard of it?

79
07:04.945 --> 07:09.532
The man arrested in Manila was shouting, "this is a game."

80
07:12.618 --> 07:15.246
Sorry, I couldn't tell you.

81
07:15.997 --> 07:18.541
I'm being forced to play the game.

82
07:18.874 --> 07:20.167
What?!

83
07:21.127 --> 07:23.129
This is my crash pad.

84
07:23.421 --> 07:25.881
Don't expect a five-star stay.

85
07:26.298 --> 07:27.508
Thanks.

86
07:28.467 --> 07:30.261
How dare you lie!

87
07:30.678 --> 07:35.015
One hostage was killed! Saori could be next.

88
07:36.725 --> 07:38.269
I'm sorry.

89
07:40.646 --> 07:43.107
The only reason I have this job...

90
07:44.567 --> 07:46.360
is because of Saori.

91
07:49.243 --> 07:53.456
Six years ago, I felt the whole world was against me.

92
07:54.970 --> 07:55.470
6 YEARS AGO

93
07:55.495 --> 07:57.289
Explain yourself.

94
07:57.446 --> 07:59.756
I told you to verify everything.

95
08:00.044 --> 08:02.755
How dare you make a mistake of fact!

96
08:02.918 --> 08:07.506
We're getting crucified by other networks, both on and offline!

97
08:07.590 --> 08:09.759
This is on your head.

98
08:16.849 --> 08:19.268
If Saori hadn't been there...

99
08:20.227 --> 08:22.188
Here you go.

100
08:26.984 --> 08:29.695
If you don't eat and feel better,

101
08:30.237 --> 08:33.783
you won't be able to start over or make amends.

102
08:56.889 --> 09:01.143
Saori would always try to save people.

103
09:02.436 --> 09:05.022
I want to save her as much as you do.

104
09:05.606 --> 09:08.359
No more lies and secrets from now on.

105
09:10.277 --> 09:11.277
Okay.

106
09:12.279 --> 09:16.492
It's hard to imagine the hostages were chosen at random.

107
09:16.617 --> 09:20.412
There must be a common denominator...

108
09:20.538 --> 09:22.581
A reason why they were chosen.

109
09:23.207 --> 09:28.712
You mean the perp took their loved ones out of a grudge against the players?

110
09:28.963 --> 09:30.131
Exactly.

111
09:30.798 --> 09:32.716
I want to find the others.

112
09:34.593 --> 09:37.680
The Naha hostage is Tomiko Higa.

113
09:38.180 --> 09:43.686
Her son Kuranosuke is a software engineer, fairly famous in IT circles.

114
09:44.103 --> 09:48.607
He developed the Uchiake app that was popular a while back.

115
09:48.899 --> 09:50.317
Any other family?

116
09:50.693 --> 09:52.027
Doesn't look like it.

117
09:52.778 --> 09:57.199
Then there's no doubt he's the player.

118
09:57.658 --> 10:01.328
This man kidnapped in Taipei is a chef patron.

119
10:01.579 --> 10:05.624
He lives with his wife, teenage daughter, and young son.

120
10:05.875 --> 10:08.502
The children probably aren't involved.

121
10:08.586 --> 10:11.755
That leaves the wife.

122
10:11.839 --> 10:14.508
She's a model known for looking young.

123
10:15.050 --> 10:17.553
The heir kidnapped in Singapore...

124
10:19.138 --> 10:22.558
I think his girlfriend is a player.

125
10:22.808 --> 10:26.270
She made the viral kiDnap GAME post.

126
10:26.395 --> 10:28.022
Any posts after that?

127
10:28.105 --> 10:29.106
None.

128
10:29.732 --> 10:31.358
Right.

129
10:36.906 --> 10:39.950
An illness left her blind five years ago.

130
10:40.743 --> 10:46.290
Her father is a renowned surgeon, but he rarely operates now.

131
10:46.624 --> 10:50.419
Have any of you seen my daughter?

132
10:50.544 --> 10:53.297
The father's the player, then?

133
10:54.590 --> 11:00.012
But the mother is also famous and owns a popular beauty brand.

134
11:02.681 --> 11:05.184
So it's one of the parents...

135
11:07.686 --> 11:10.314
But what about the woman in Bangkok?

136
11:10.564 --> 11:15.194
Her wealthy parents are deceased with no living relatives.

137
11:15.486 --> 11:17.696
Maybe the player is her lover.

138
11:18.489 --> 11:22.034
Could be. I'll look up the men around her.

139
11:22.159 --> 11:23.452
Thanks.

140
11:24.328 --> 11:28.499
So far, nothing seems to connect everyone.

141
11:28.624 --> 11:29.917
Yeah...

142
11:30.542 --> 11:31.794
What's the plan?

143
11:32.086 --> 11:35.506
I'll have to ask the other players directly.

144
11:36.131 --> 11:40.261
Will they cooperate? "Only one shall prevail," right?

145
11:40.344 --> 11:42.846
They'll be racing to finish first.

146
11:43.263 --> 11:44.473
Yeah.

147
11:44.682 --> 11:46.976
It's all I can do at the moment.

148
11:49.103 --> 11:50.229
I need to get back.

149
11:54.066 --> 11:55.859
I'll call if I learn more.

150
11:55.943 --> 11:56.944
Okay.

151
12:12.751 --> 12:15.546
I'm in the kiDnap GAME. Can we talk?

152
12:22.761 --> 12:23.929
What do you want?

153
12:24.013 --> 12:27.016
If you’re in the game then you shouldn’t be wasting time writing to me.

154
12:28.392 --> 12:30.185
I want to identify the kidnapper.

155
12:30.602 --> 12:33.856
There must be a common denominator among us players somewhere.

156
12:35.774 --> 12:38.027
Common denominator...?

157
12:41.363 --> 12:44.950
I don’t know. I’m in a hurry to complete some kind of mission.

158
12:45.075 --> 12:46.216
He’ll die if I’m late.

159
12:47.882 --> 12:48.982
We’ve arrived.

160
12:55.753 --> 12:58.881
I don’t have anything to say to you. Don’t text me!

161
13:29.995 --> 13:33.499
CHECKPOINT ONE CLEARED. AWAIT NEXT INSTRUCTION.

162
13:50.766 --> 13:53.477
I’M IN THE KIDNAP GAME. CAN WE TALK?

163
13:53.852 --> 13:54.852
What's this?

164
13:56.396 --> 13:57.396
What?

165
13:57.981 --> 13:59.010
"kiDnap GAME?"

166
14:08.117 --> 14:09.176
Come.

167
14:14.123 --> 14:15.415
Show me.

168
14:18.949 --> 14:20.951
TOSHIRO NIIDE

169
14:21.213 --> 14:23.215
kiDnap... as in "kidnap"?

170
14:25.676 --> 14:27.261
Are you in it too?!

171
14:27.344 --> 14:29.138
You can't be serious.

172
14:29.221 --> 14:32.057
Was Rian kidnapped for a game?!

173
14:32.141 --> 14:33.934
Calm down. It's a prank!

174
14:34.017 --> 14:35.037
We've got to reply...

175
14:35.844 --> 14:38.603
What do I say? I'll do anything to save her!

176
14:39.106 --> 14:42.943
Look, please just calm down...

177
14:46.697 --> 14:50.075
I'll save Rian...

178
14:50.159 --> 14:54.037
I'll definitely save her.

179
15:00.669 --> 15:02.963
I'm in the kiDnap GAME. Let's talk.

180
15:12.389 --> 15:13.807
What's your mission?

181
15:18.270 --> 15:20.189
To capture the mastermind.

182
15:24.693 --> 15:27.571
I gain nothing by cooperating. I will win.

183
15:34.411 --> 15:36.205
I just want to talk.

184
15:52.971 --> 15:54.306
AKINA ISOBE

185
15:57.643 --> 15:58.810
Any leads?

186
15:59.068 --> 16:02.488
The woman in Bangkok hangs out with a few men,

187
16:02.606 --> 16:04.430
but no one seems to be special.

188
16:04.853 --> 16:06.396
I see...

189
16:06.777 --> 16:08.904
But she has a female roommate.

190
16:08.987 --> 16:10.239
A roommate...

191
16:10.322 --> 16:14.034
Apparently she's a hostess renting the room.

192
16:15.035 --> 16:16.488
Thanks for the tip.

193
16:17.329 --> 16:19.164
Any details on the roommate?

194
16:19.248 --> 16:20.788
I'll send a link.

195
16:21.785 --> 16:24.336
PM 07:14 JST

196
16:50.946 --> 16:52.670
Matching misanga bracelets...

197
17:02.374 --> 17:05.252
I’M IN THE KIDNAP GAME. CAN WE TALK?

198
17:08.714 --> 17:10.340
Come on...

199
17:13.635 --> 17:16.179
OK

200
17:22.060 --> 17:24.771
Coming late and bringing a partner...

201
17:24.896 --> 17:26.773
- Never mind. - Right?

202
17:26.898 --> 17:28.650
- Let it go. - Right?

203
17:29.568 --> 17:33.030
BENZ WANG'S DAUGHTER IN STUDENT PROTESTS

204
17:33.155 --> 17:36.325
I was wondering why they came here.

205
17:36.658 --> 17:39.870
Well, Hansa said her dad's super rich.

206
17:40.454 --> 17:44.416
Hi. I’m the player from Tokyo... English okay?

207
17:45.083 --> 17:46.877
Yes, English is okay.

208
17:47.294 --> 17:49.212
I’m Aum. Bangkok.

209
17:49.963 --> 17:53.884
You’re participating for Dao Saetang, is that right?

210
17:54.134 --> 17:56.496
- Yup. - Thanks.

211
17:57.054 --> 17:59.222
My wife was kidnapped.

212
17:59.973 --> 18:06.480
Tokyo... so you’re police, right? What’s your mission?

213
18:07.022 --> 18:08.649
To capture the mastermind.

214
18:09.149 --> 18:14.988
You’re trying to catch the mastermind to finish the game to save your wife, huh?

215
18:15.781 --> 18:16.990
No!

216
18:17.199 --> 18:22.371
The second you catch the mastermind, you win the game.

217
18:22.496 --> 18:24.706
Then all the other hostages will die.

218
18:25.165 --> 18:28.377
- Sorry, I can’t work with you. - Why?

219
18:29.044 --> 18:31.046
You helped me make up my mind.

220
18:33.298 --> 18:35.983
I’m gonna try and complete my own mission.

221
18:37.784 --> 18:38.784
Wait!

222
19:31.356 --> 19:34.860
PLEASE DON’T CONTACT MY WIFE.

223
19:34.932 --> 19:36.183
Wife...

224
19:39.573 --> 19:41.283
So it's the doctor...

225
19:48.999 --> 19:52.252
ARE YOU THE ONE IN THE GAME?

226
20:00.886 --> 20:04.431
I WANT TO WORK TOGETHER. PLEASE TALK TO ME.

227
20:29.039 --> 20:30.624
I believe you.

228
20:33.251 --> 20:35.003
I believe in you.

229
20:38.965 --> 20:39.965
DAY 3

230
20:39.966 --> 20:42.469
XX UNIVERSITY, BANGKOK AM 11:02 ICT

231
20:53.104 --> 20:55.850
Whoa, you've made a lot already.

232
20:56.441 --> 20:57.816
At the cost of my sleep.

233
21:02.489 --> 21:07.744
Don't overdo it. You don't look well.

234
21:08.829 --> 21:10.956
You head home. I'll do the rest.

235
21:11.748 --> 21:14.751
Okay. I'll go home.

236
21:21.091 --> 21:22.634
Hansa Wang?

237
21:26.972 --> 21:27.972
Get in there.

238
21:32.727 --> 21:33.979
What's going on?

239
21:34.479 --> 21:36.856
- Get lost! - Hansa?!

240
21:51.746 --> 21:53.415
Call your father.

241
21:54.457 --> 21:55.333
My father?

242
21:55.458 --> 21:59.004
Benz Wang! Yes! Now!

243
22:01.590 --> 22:02.465
Sir?

244
22:02.549 --> 22:03.800
What is it?

245
22:04.342 --> 22:05.760
It's your daughter.

246
22:07.012 --> 22:08.263
Hansa?

247
22:09.723 --> 22:10.932
I'm done talking.

248
22:11.016 --> 22:12.976
Something doesn't seem right.

249
22:17.522 --> 22:18.690
What?

250
22:19.065 --> 22:23.445
Publicly confess to your crimes or I'll kill your daughter.

251
22:24.404 --> 22:28.825
What's going on? Is this a joke?

252
22:29.618 --> 22:32.913
Save me! Please!

253
22:34.748 --> 22:36.124
You got that?

254
22:36.333 --> 22:41.004
Come clean publicly or your daughter dies.

255
22:45.675 --> 22:48.011
Wait, come clean about what?

256
22:48.094 --> 22:52.849
Your ties to the drug syndicate! You're in collusion, right?!

257
22:53.266 --> 22:57.729
Get the press there and tell the country!

258
23:44.526 --> 23:46.194
Why are you doing this?

259
23:47.153 --> 23:48.863
Just behave yourself.

260
23:49.614 --> 23:51.825
My father disowned me.

261
23:53.702 --> 23:56.454
It doesn't matter. A parent's a parent.

262
23:56.538 --> 24:00.458
Don't make any funny moves or I'll kill you.

263
24:15.098 --> 24:18.601
Assault team is in position. Shall we move in?

264
24:19.227 --> 24:24.691
The building is completely surrounded.

265
24:25.066 --> 24:29.863
Release the hostage and surrender immediately.

266
24:30.113 --> 24:34.492
A hostage crisis is unfolding at this university in Bangkok.

267
24:35.452 --> 24:41.124
A young woman armed with a knife has taken a student prisoner.

268
24:44.544 --> 24:46.004
Don't come any closer.

269
24:47.047 --> 24:49.549
If you do, I'll kill her.

270
24:51.509 --> 24:54.012
I only have one demand!

271
24:54.888 --> 24:56.264
Benz Wang!

272
24:57.098 --> 24:59.392
If you want to save your daughter,

273
24:59.601 --> 25:04.272
admit your ties to the drug syndicate and make a public confession!

274
25:07.275 --> 25:09.319
The captor has made a demand.

275
25:09.402 --> 25:11.696
She wants M.P. Benz Wang

276
25:11.780 --> 25:16.409
to publicly confess his alleged drug syndicate ties.

277
25:16.493 --> 25:21.372
The hostage has been identified as Hansa Wang, daughter of...

278
25:21.456 --> 25:22.957
Dammit.

279
25:23.374 --> 25:25.019
According to local police, the hostage, identified as Hansa Wang...

280
25:25.043 --> 25:28.213
STANDOFF IN BANGKOK. CAPTOR IS LIKELY A KIDNAP GAME PLAYER.

281
25:34.636 --> 25:36.221
So what?!

282
25:46.564 --> 25:51.277
The captor demands that Benz Wang publicly admit links...

283
25:52.403 --> 25:54.197
We have a new development.

284
25:54.280 --> 25:58.284
A student was taken hostage at a Bangkok university...

285
25:58.368 --> 26:03.039
The hostage has been identified as the daughter of Benz Wang...

286
26:04.791 --> 26:07.836
I hope you're not contacting the detective.

287
26:09.712 --> 26:12.132
Unless you're gathering info,

288
26:12.215 --> 26:16.594
you'll be committing another grave offense as a journalist.

289
26:17.929 --> 26:19.472
We're not in contact.

290
26:19.931 --> 26:23.726
I'll have you know, the police came asking about you.

291
26:32.694 --> 26:33.570
Yes?

292
26:33.653 --> 26:35.446
Get out of there.

293
26:35.530 --> 26:36.530
What?

294
26:36.573 --> 26:40.159
The police are on to me. It's not safe there.

295
26:41.536 --> 26:42.704
Got it.

296
27:12.984 --> 27:14.116
He's here!

297
27:24.829 --> 27:26.456
Give up already!

298
27:31.294 --> 27:32.462
Run!

299
27:33.630 --> 27:35.256
Go!

300
27:36.049 --> 27:37.133
Niide!

301
27:44.265 --> 27:45.391
Hyodo...

302
27:54.817 --> 27:55.693
Hello?

303
27:55.777 --> 27:59.656
This is Uemura, from the food truck.

304
28:00.823 --> 28:01.823
What is it?

305
28:02.241 --> 28:06.955
Just now, a young man left me a package to give to you.

306
28:08.164 --> 28:09.749
A young man?

307
28:10.333 --> 28:11.751
PM 01:35 ICT

308
28:11.793 --> 28:14.754
What are you waiting for?

309
28:15.588 --> 28:18.716
The hostage is a politician's daughter.

310
28:18.800 --> 28:23.471
If anything happens to her, we'll be in serious trouble.

311
28:47.745 --> 28:50.373
If you die, it'll all be for nothing.

312
28:54.377 --> 28:55.712
Thanks.

313
29:11.144 --> 29:12.186
Where's yours?

314
29:12.854 --> 29:16.691
That's all I have. I didn't think it'd take this long.

315
29:19.027 --> 29:21.446
LIVE FROM M.P. BENZ WANG'S HOME

316
29:22.030 --> 29:25.158
What you said about my father...

317
29:27.201 --> 29:28.619
Is it true?

318
29:36.085 --> 29:40.548
I heard that rumor once and demanded answers from him.

319
29:44.802 --> 29:49.640
That's why he disowned me.

320
29:52.018 --> 29:53.352
I'm sorry...

321
29:55.730 --> 29:57.732
for dragging you into this.

322
29:58.357 --> 30:02.070
I'll confess to his crimes instead. So don't do this.

323
30:02.570 --> 30:04.364
That's no use.

324
30:08.993 --> 30:11.913
You know about the simultaneous kidnappings?

325
30:13.414 --> 30:14.624
Yes.

326
30:17.085 --> 30:19.378
My girlfriend was kidnapped.

327
30:22.673 --> 30:29.180
The kidnapper told me to make Benz Wang publicly confess his drug syndicate ties.

328
30:31.474 --> 30:33.935
Said it was a kiDnap GAME.

329
30:35.645 --> 30:39.363
KiDnap GAME... I thought it was only a rumor.

330
30:41.067 --> 30:42.180
No...

331
30:44.779 --> 30:48.463
I couldn't think of a better way.

332
30:50.952 --> 30:57.500
That person must be so precious to you for you to do this.

333
30:58.876 --> 31:00.622
Dao's my first true love.

334
31:04.257 --> 31:06.384
I'd do anything for her.

335
31:10.221 --> 31:12.100
I owe my life to Dao.

336
31:13.599 --> 31:17.356
I used to be addicted to marijuana and my life was a mess...

337
31:18.688 --> 31:21.376
She set me back on my feet.

338
31:39.083 --> 31:40.710
Where do you live?

339
31:43.337 --> 31:45.323
I don't have a home.

340
31:50.845 --> 31:51.845
What?

341
31:54.515 --> 32:00.855
Dao has a big apartment, and she let me live there.

342
32:11.490 --> 32:14.535
But I didn't want to be a burden to her.

343
32:15.786 --> 32:17.465
I wanted to be her equal.

344
32:20.166 --> 32:27.340
So I started doing bad things again to earn money.

345
32:28.174 --> 32:31.844
You're still smoking this stuff?!

346
32:32.470 --> 32:34.083
I thought you already quit!

347
32:35.056 --> 32:36.807
You promised me.

348
32:38.392 --> 32:39.977
I don't use it anymore.

349
32:40.061 --> 32:41.590
Then what's this?

350
32:45.316 --> 32:50.183
Are you still dealing?

351
32:51.239 --> 32:52.596
Why, Aum?!

352
32:54.220 --> 32:56.158
It's the only way I know how to live!

353
33:08.714 --> 33:10.883
Deep down, I knew Dao was right.

354
33:14.095 --> 33:17.139
I just didn't want to lose her.

355
33:18.057 --> 33:20.309
Dao waited for me to come home...

356
33:22.228 --> 33:24.564
and that's when they took her.

357
33:30.987 --> 33:32.154
Aum!

358
33:36.867 --> 33:38.619
A present from Aum.

359
33:39.870 --> 33:41.289
From Aum?

360
33:47.295 --> 33:48.337
Dao!

361
33:48.421 --> 33:52.508
When I went back to apologize,

362
33:52.967 --> 33:55.845
she was already gone...

363
33:58.055 --> 33:59.974
I never told her how I felt.

364
34:03.978 --> 34:06.439
That's why I'd do anything...

365
34:09.817 --> 34:11.694
to see Dao one more time.

366
34:16.282 --> 34:18.034
I'll help you.

367
34:22.580 --> 34:23.456
Sir?

368
34:23.539 --> 34:25.291
- What? - Look at this.

369
34:27.585 --> 34:32.214
Dad, please admit and confess what you did... Please!

370
34:33.841 --> 34:36.677
If you don't confess within an hour...

371
34:38.763 --> 34:44.477
Please help me, Dad! Please!

372
34:47.938 --> 34:49.357
This is a live video.

373
34:49.649 --> 34:52.360
How will Mr. Benz respond?

374
34:52.651 --> 34:57.281
His daughter's being held hostage, and he still won't confess?

375
34:57.448 --> 34:59.116
Look at this.

376
34:59.200 --> 35:02.036
He still won't come clean.

377
35:02.119 --> 35:04.455
Oh my god. I hope she makes it.

378
35:06.874 --> 35:08.417
The package you mentioned...

379
35:11.420 --> 35:13.089
This is it.

380
35:13.881 --> 35:15.216
That's him!

381
35:18.928 --> 35:20.012
That bastard...

382
35:20.096 --> 35:21.722
He brought this.

383
35:28.187 --> 35:30.064
- Get rid of it! - Huh?!

384
35:30.147 --> 35:31.190
Now!

385
35:44.495 --> 35:45.871
Dammit.

386
35:49.750 --> 35:51.502
Are you okay?

387
35:51.585 --> 35:52.920
I'm fine.

388
35:53.170 --> 35:55.131
What was that?

389
35:55.297 --> 35:58.676
Sorry, it's all my fault...

390
36:00.302 --> 36:01.496
He acted strange.

391
36:02.476 --> 36:05.141
He talked to me in Korean at first.

392
36:05.190 --> 36:06.608
Hello.

393
36:08.269 --> 36:11.063
Can you give this to detective Niide?

394
36:13.107 --> 36:16.819
Can you give this to a detective called "Niide"?

395
36:17.570 --> 36:18.570
Korean?

396
36:18.946 --> 36:19.946
Yes.

397
36:23.951 --> 36:26.036
Sorry, I'll call you later.

398
36:32.626 --> 36:35.563
Please... Just confess!

399
36:45.055 --> 36:46.682
You okay?

400
36:47.183 --> 36:50.728
It's my asthma... I have an inhaler in my bag...

401
36:58.652 --> 36:59.904
This bag?

402
37:00.613 --> 37:01.822
No.

403
37:06.744 --> 37:11.373
Confess your crime, Benz Wang, or your daughter dies.

404
37:25.346 --> 37:26.606
Call a press conference.

405
37:32.603 --> 37:36.440
Mr. Wang is ready to begin the press conference.

406
37:36.524 --> 37:37.775
Please come in.

407
37:38.275 --> 37:42.655
We've been called inside. Benz Wang may be about to confess.

408
37:45.115 --> 37:49.578
They said he's going to make a confession.

409
37:52.498 --> 37:57.795
Then your loved one's going to be safe.

410
38:00.047 --> 38:02.049
Yeah. Thanks.

411
38:11.851 --> 38:14.019
BENZ TO HOLD PRESS CONFERENCE

412
38:14.103 --> 38:15.104
Really?

413
38:26.240 --> 38:28.909
What's the situation, sir?

414
38:29.034 --> 38:30.995
What can you tell us?

415
38:31.161 --> 38:34.790
Have you been in contact with your daughter?

416
38:34.915 --> 38:39.336
What can you tell us? Answer, please!

417
38:39.461 --> 38:43.716
Is it true that your daughter was kidnapped?

418
38:45.593 --> 38:50.848
I swear by the gods of heaven and earth, and by my beloved daughter.

419
38:52.182 --> 38:55.978
What I am about to tell the citizens of Thailand

420
38:58.272 --> 39:01.900
and the whole world is the truth.

421
39:07.364 --> 39:08.865
THE TIME LIMIT IS TEN DAYS.

422
39:08.866 --> 39:11.266
THE GAME WILL END IF A PLAYER COMPLETES THE ASSIGNED MISSION.

423
39:13.913 --> 39:16.165
ONLY ONE SHALL PREVAIL...

424
39:19.793 --> 39:22.171
ONLY ONE SHALL SURVIVE...

425
39:24.506 --> 39:26.050
I, Benz Wang...

426
39:32.473 --> 39:36.136
have no ties to any drug syndicate or similar organization!

427
39:37.394 --> 39:38.812
Goddamn it!

428
39:40.022 --> 39:41.022
Even if it means

429
39:42.191 --> 39:47.029
losing my beloved daughter, I cannot lie to the people.

430
39:48.948 --> 39:52.756
Nor can I ever bend to cowardly blackmail.

431
39:53.828 --> 39:56.256
Hansa... My beloved daughter...

432
39:56.789 --> 40:02.753
Please forgive your fool of a father.

433
40:14.306 --> 40:16.684
Gimme a goddamn break!

434
40:20.980 --> 40:23.482
This is bad. SWAT team, standby.

435
40:23.565 --> 40:24.565
Yes sir!

436
40:32.449 --> 40:36.912
What should I do?

437
40:40.457 --> 40:41.959
AUM THANAWAT

438
40:45.254 --> 40:49.800
Officer! It’s me, Aum, the player in Bangkok. I-I’m...

439
40:50.551 --> 40:53.887
I know, you’re barricaded in there, right?

440
40:55.180 --> 40:58.684
Yes, but the police could break in any second.

441
40:58.934 --> 41:01.645
You’re the only person I can count on...

442
41:01.770 --> 41:04.690
Please tell me what should I do?

443
41:10.738 --> 41:14.241
- Let's move in! Everyone ready? - Ready!

444
41:23.917 --> 41:25.002
Aum,

445
41:26.754 --> 41:28.464
you’ve got to surrender.

446
41:32.009 --> 41:36.889
No... If I give up now, Dao will be killed.

447
41:37.723 --> 41:43.520
At this rate, your hostage... is going to die.

448
41:46.607 --> 41:48.430
You will have killed her.

449
41:49.818 --> 41:51.136
Killed that innocent girl.

450
42:09.338 --> 42:11.673
Dao’s innocent, too!

451
42:15.385 --> 42:17.596
Dao didn’t do anything wrong...

452
42:18.889 --> 42:20.224
That’s right.

453
42:21.892 --> 42:26.480
People who did nothing wrong were taken hostage for this game.

454
42:35.614 --> 42:39.076
I want to save those innocent people.

455
42:42.996 --> 42:48.544
If I surrender, I’ll be disqualified for failing,

456
42:48.669 --> 42:52.214
and not completing my mission, and Dao will...

457
42:52.339 --> 42:55.968
But she will be saved.

458
43:01.431 --> 43:03.767
She’s the only one you can save!

459
43:09.606 --> 43:10.941
Please...

460
43:13.318 --> 43:14.862
Please save her...

461
43:42.222 --> 43:43.222
Officer...

462
43:46.560 --> 43:48.295
was there no other way?

463
44:53.961 --> 44:56.338
MAKE YOUR WISH COME TRUE

464
44:57.881 --> 45:01.969
Ever wanted something so much that you'd try one of these?

465
45:05.931 --> 45:07.057
I might have.

466
45:07.349 --> 45:09.768
What was it? Can't you tell me?

467
45:10.185 --> 45:11.812
That'd be giving it away.

468
45:18.610 --> 45:20.570
Two of these, please.

469
45:34.864 --> 45:37.575
What did you wish for, Dao?

470
45:38.422 --> 45:39.422
Nothing.

471
45:40.007 --> 45:42.884
But if we both wear these,

472
45:44.088 --> 45:48.096
your wish will come true sooner, don't you think?

473
46:27.546 --> 46:31.395
You're right. It came true right away.

474
46:32.768 --> 46:34.519
Pretty impressive, right?

475
46:37.689 --> 46:39.236
Are you sure about this?

476
46:40.233 --> 46:42.527
As long as you're happy.

477
46:43.945 --> 46:46.448
Only you truly love me.

478
46:59.669 --> 47:01.213
I'm sorry.

479
47:07.511 --> 47:10.347
Listen, everyone!

480
47:10.430 --> 47:13.266
Someone is about to be killed!

481
47:13.350 --> 47:16.269
Her name is Dao! Please save her!

482
48:13.994 --> 48:16.955
AUM THANAWAT HAS BEEN DISQUALIFIED.

483
48:44.733 --> 48:45.733
Breaking news.

484
48:46.067 --> 48:51.990
The woman who took a student hostage at a Bangkok university

485
48:52.073 --> 48:54.784
has been taken into police custody.

486
48:54.868 --> 48:59.831
The hostage is confirmed to be unharmed.

487
49:03.493 --> 49:04.953
Officer...

488
49:05.712 --> 49:07.470
was there no other way?

489
49:21.213 --> 49:24.509
Put your anger aside. Show your kindness...

490
49:26.525 --> 49:30.779
Kindness that shields the weak.

491
49:34.199 --> 49:41.164
That's the right thing to do.

492
49:45.377 --> 49:46.920
Wait for me...

493
49:58.974 --> 50:01.935
I saw the news from Bangkok. What’s your mission?

494
50:06.439 --> 50:07.941
To capture the mastermind.

495
50:10.902 --> 50:13.196
Mine is to commit murder.

496
50:21.579 --> 50:23.206
What do you plan to do?

497
50:56.114 --> 50:59.094
Complete my mission to save my daughter.

498
51:04.789 --> 51:06.541
Please don't be hasty.

499
51:06.850 --> 51:11.647
I will capture the mastermind. Then I will rescue your daughter, too.

500
51:32.650 --> 51:34.319
Don’t interfere...

501
51:34.402 --> 51:38.365
I will complete my mission and save Rian by any means possible.

502
51:41.743 --> 51:43.787
With this doctor's daughter...

503
51:43.995 --> 51:46.623
He talked to me in Korean at first.

504
51:47.916 --> 51:51.795
Korea... Seoul...

505
51:59.094 --> 52:03.765
I will solve this case and save everyone mixed up in it. Including you.
